{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned laboratory named Ascendora to find the answers you've been looking for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the laboratory for more information and unravel the secrets of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However beware, there may be unknown dangers hiding in the dark...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Ascendora</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascendora is a story based horror game played in first person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the child of a scientist who went missing after an accident at the laboratory they owned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though you were taken care of by old friends of your parents, they refused to tell you anything about them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious to know who they were they are or what happend to them, you finally get your first lead on where to look:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laboratory Ascendora</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the secrets and hidden lore of Ascendora and your parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has to find a way to navigate the building. Deactivate security systems and find a way to get around the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might have to find tools hidden around the facility to help you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descent into the lower levels of the lab to find out the truth of everything that happend.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2285930?t=1749143135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285930/49515cf9c11f14c3be5ae6f3a1110eb38f1a9f8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749143135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285930/c22cc7d1e598a9c54f963ce3e273cc102d7c14be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749143135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285930/c22cc7d1e598a9c54f963ce3e273cc102d7c14be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749143135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3756460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned laboratory named Ascendora to find the answers you've been looking for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the laboratory for more information and unravel the secrets of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However beware, there may be unknown dangers hiding in the dark...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Ascendora</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascendora is a story based horror game played in first person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the child of a scientist who went missing after an accident at the laboratory they owned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though you were taken care of by old friends of your parents, they refused to tell you anything about them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious to know who they were they are or what happend to them, you finally get your first lead on where to look:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laboratory Ascendora</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the secrets and hidden lore of Ascendora and your parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has to find a way to navigate the building. Deactivate security systems and find a way to get around the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might have to find tools hidden around the facility to help you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descent into the lower levels of the lab to find out the truth of everything that happend.</p>","developers":["Beepy Games"],"genres":[{"description":